{"id":"50cdef7ad50f7128","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes.md","title":"基数与连续统断言的成员语言公式码","display":"df-set-theory-sentence-codes — 基数与连续统断言的成员语言公式码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes","aliases":["58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes"],"display":"df-set-theory-sentence-codes — 基数与连续统断言的成员语言公式码","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-theory-sentence-codes — 基数与连续统断言的成员语言公式码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,f,a,b,c,o,k,p\">\\(x,y,z,f,a,b,c,o,k,p\\)</span> 在公式码函数的参数位置均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 中的变量码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists!\">\\(\\exists,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists!\\)</span> 采用 <code>58-ax-zfc</code> 的派生语法展开，最终仅使用等号、成员关系及一阶基本构造子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists u\\in x\\,\\psi\">\\(\\exists u\\in x\\,\\psi\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists u(u\\dot\\in x\\land\\psi)\">\\(\\exists u(u\\dot\\in x\\land\\psi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in x\\,\\psi\">\\(\\forall u\\in x\\,\\psi\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall u(u\\dot\\in x\\to\\psi)\">\\(\\forall u(u\\dot\\in x\\to\\psi)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>在公式码的右式内嵌入另一个公式码函数值时，该值作为语法子树插入，不增加任何对象语言谓词符号。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)\\land\\psi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)\\land\\psi\\urcorner\\)</span> 的左子树就是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>每条公式码定义右侧新增的束缚变量，按该式从左到右的首次束缚顺序，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreshVariables}_{58}(F,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreshVariables}_{58}(F,m)\\)</span> 的各值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是该式左侧全部变量码参数的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 是新增束缚变量的数目。相同印刷字母在不同定义中不共享变量码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!\">\\(\\exists!\\)</span> 的展开再按同一规则取新变量。</li>\n<li>下列公式码只在上述变量码参数域上使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalCode}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdinalCode}_{58}\\)</span> 采用“传递的、其元素皆传递的集合”表达式；本文件下游的模型均满足 ZFC。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FreshVariables}_{58}(F,m)=s\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land |F|&lt;\\omega\\land m\\in\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,m,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;\ns(i)=v_{\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:v_j\\notin F\\cup\\{s(h):h&lt;i\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FreshVariables}_{58}(F,m)=s\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land |F|&lt;\\omega\\land m\\in\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,m,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;\ns(i)=v_{\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:v_j\\notin F\\cup\\{s(h):h&lt;i\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in x\\to u\\dot\\in y)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in x\\to u\\dot\\in y)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EmptyCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;\\neg(u\\dot\\in x)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EmptyCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;\\neg(u\\dot\\in x)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingletonCode}_{58}(z,x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in z\\leftrightarrow u\\doteq x)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SingletonCode}_{58}(z,x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in z\\leftrightarrow u\\doteq x)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DoubletonCode}_{58}(z,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in z\\leftrightarrow(u\\doteq x\\lor u\\doteq y))\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DoubletonCode}_{58}(z,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in z\\leftrightarrow(u\\doteq x\\lor u\\doteq y))\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in p\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{SingletonCode}_{58}(u,x)\\lor\\mathrm{DoubletonCode}_{58}(u,x,y)))\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in p\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{SingletonCode}_{58}(u,x)\\lor\\mathrm{DoubletonCode}_{58}(u,x,y)))\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\exists p\\in f\\;\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\exists p\\in f\\;\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FunctionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner&amp;\n(\\forall p\\in f\\;\\exists x\\in a\\;\\exists y\\in b\\;\n\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;\\exists!y\\;(y\\dot\\in b\\land\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y))\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FunctionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner&amp;\n(\\forall p\\in f\\;\\exists x\\in a\\;\\exists y\\in b\\;\n\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;\\exists!y\\;(y\\dot\\in b\\land\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y))\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{FunctionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\n\\land\\forall y\\in b\\;\\exists!x\\;(x\\dot\\in a\\land\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y))\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{FunctionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\n\\land\\forall y\\in b\\;\\exists!x\\;(x\\dot\\in a\\land\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y))\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall y\\in x\\;\\forall z\\in y\\;(z\\dot\\in x)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TransitiveCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall y\\in x\\;\\forall z\\in y\\;(z\\dot\\in x)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{TransitiveCode}_{58}(x)\n\\land\\forall y\\in x\\;\\mathrm{TransitiveCode}_{58}(y)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrdinalCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{TransitiveCode}_{58}(x)\n\\land\\forall y\\in x\\;\\mathrm{TransitiveCode}_{58}(y)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCode}_{58}(b,a)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall x\\;(x\\dot\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\dot\\in a\\lor x\\doteq a))\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SuccessorCode}_{58}(b,a)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall x\\;(x\\dot\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\dot\\in a\\lor x\\doteq a))\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InductiveCode}_{58}(a)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner(\\exists z\\in a\\;\\mathrm{EmptyCode}_{58}(z))\n\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;\\exists y\\in a\\;\\mathrm{SuccessorCode}_{58}(y,x)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{InductiveCode}_{58}(a)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner(\\exists z\\in a\\;\\mathrm{EmptyCode}_{58}(z))\n\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;\\exists y\\in a\\;\\mathrm{SuccessorCode}_{58}(y,x)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OmegaCode}_{58}(o)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{InductiveCode}_{58}(o)\n\\land\\forall a\\;(\\mathrm{InductiveCode}_{58}(a)\\to\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(o,a))\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OmegaCode}_{58}(o)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{InductiveCode}_{58}(o)\n\\land\\forall a\\;(\\mathrm{InductiveCode}_{58}(a)\\to\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(o,a))\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowerSetCode}_{58}(p,a)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall x\\;(x\\dot\\in p\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,a))\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PowerSetCode}_{58}(p,a)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall x\\;(x\\dot\\in p\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,a))\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{OrdinalCode}_{58}(k)\n\\land\\forall a\\in k\\;\\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,a,k)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{OrdinalCode}_{58}(k)\n\\land\\forall a\\in k\\;\\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,a,k)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NextCardinalCode}_{58}(b,a)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner&amp;\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(a)\\land\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(b)\n\\land a\\dot\\in b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in b\\;(\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(c)\n\\to(c\\dot\\in a\\lor c\\doteq a))\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NextCardinalCode}_{58}(b,a)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner&amp;\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(a)\\land\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(b)\n\\land a\\dot\\in b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in b\\;(\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(c)\n\\to(c\\dot\\in a\\lor c\\doteq a))\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuumEqualsCode}_{58}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\exists o\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists f\\;\n(\\mathrm{OmegaCode}_{58}(o)\\land\\mathrm{PowerSetCode}_{58}(p,o)\n\\land\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,p,k))\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ContinuumEqualsCode}_{58}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\exists o\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists f\\;\n(\\mathrm{OmegaCode}_{58}(o)\\land\\mathrm{PowerSetCode}_{58}(p,o)\n\\land\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,p,k))\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CHCode}_{58}\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\exists o\\;\\exists a\\;\n(\\mathrm{OmegaCode}_{58}(o)\\land\\mathrm{NextCardinalCode}_{58}(a,o)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContinuumEqualsCode}_{58}(a))\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CHCode}_{58}\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\exists o\\;\\exists a\\;\n(\\mathrm{OmegaCode}_{58}(o)\\land\\mathrm{NextCardinalCode}_{58}(a,o)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContinuumEqualsCode}_{58}(a))\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GCHCode}_{58}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\forall k\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(k)\n\\land\\exists o\\;(\\mathrm{OmegaCode}_{58}(o)\\land(o\\doteq k\\lor o\\dot\\in k))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists b\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists f\\;(\n\\mathrm{NextCardinalCode}_{58}(b,k)\\land\\mathrm{PowerSetCode}_{58}(p,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,p,b))\\Bigr)\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GCHCode}_{58}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\forall k\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalCode}_{58}(k)\n\\land\\exists o\\;(\\mathrm{OmegaCode}_{58}(o)\\land(o\\doteq k\\lor o\\dot\\in k))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists b\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists f\\;(\n\\mathrm{NextCardinalCode}_{58}(b,k)\\land\\mathrm{PowerSetCode}_{58}(p,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,p,b))\\Bigr)\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohenContinuumCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{ContinuumEqualsCode}_{58}(x)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CHCode}_{58}\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CohenContinuumCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{ContinuumEqualsCode}_{58}(x)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CHCode}_{58}\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这些是成员语言的公式码构造，不是把元语言的 CH 真值直接插入强迫关系。书内已有的 CH、GCH 语义谓词不受更改。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z,f,a,b,c,o,k,p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists!","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists u\\in x\\,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists u(u\\dot\\in x\\land\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall u\\in x\\,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall u(u\\dot\\in x\\to\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)\\land\\psi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreshVariables}_{58}(F,m)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdinalCode}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FreshVariables}_{58}(F,m)=s\\leftrightarrow{}&\nF\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land |F|<\\omega\\land m\\in\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,m,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<m\\;\ns(i)=v_{\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:v_j\\notin F\\cup\\{s(h):h<i\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubCode}_{58}(x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in x\\to u\\dot\\in y)\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EmptyCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;\\neg(u\\dot\\in x)\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SingletonCode}_{58}(z,x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in z\\leftrightarrow u\\doteq x)\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DoubletonCode}_{58}(z,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in z\\leftrightarrow(u\\doteq x\\lor u\\doteq y))\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall u\\;(u\\dot\\in p\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{SingletonCode}_{58}(u,x)\\lor\\mathrm{DoubletonCode}_{58}(u,x,y)))\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\exists p\\in f\\;\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y)\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FunctionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner&\n(\\forall p\\in f\\;\\exists x\\in a\\;\\exists y\\in b\\;\n\\mathrm{OrderedPairCode}_{58}(p,x,y))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;\\exists!y\\;(y\\dot\\in b\\land\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y))\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BijectionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{FunctionCode}_{58}(f,a,b)\n\\land\\forall y\\in b\\;\\exists!x\\;(x\\dot\\in a\\land\\mathrm{GraphValueCode}_{58}(f,x,y))\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveCode}_{58}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\forall y\\in x\\;\\forall z\\in y\\;(z\\dot\\in x)\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"